       "id": "1a.1",
       "text": "A waterborne disease outbreak affected the Ondaraya Delta from early June 2025, centred on Kelvaig village and the southern wards of Serriport.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      },
      {
       "id": "1a.3",
       "text": "The likely source was an interruption of chlorination at the Meskin Reservoir intake during pump repairs, with untreated canal water used in Kelvaig during the gap.",
       "confidence": "confirmed",
       "tweet_ids": []
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
